/seasonal-hydromet-bulletin/kiremt-2026-assessment-and-bega-2026_27-hydro-met-bulletin/"},"emi_bega_2026_27_outlook_comparison_map":{"label":"Comparison map (emi_bega_2026_27_outlook)","file":"emi_bega_2026_27_outlook_anchors.png"},"icpac_ond_2026_update_rainfall_comparison_map":{"label":"Comparison map (icpac_ond_2026_update_rainfall)","file":"icpac_ond_2026_update_rainfall_comparison.png"}},"notes":["Area means are area-weighted means of local grid-cell probabilities, not probabilities of area-mean rainfall.","Favoured category: the leading tercile where it reaches 40% (the map display rule); otherwise no clear category.","An OND probability cannot be built by averaging monthly probabilities; ONDJ and OND are compared only as spatial tendencies."],"created_utc":"2026-10-09T09:02:31+00:00","engine":"rules v1"}